## Title: Classic UI for Forever
## Notes: Brings the classic look back on World of Warcraft Forever: nameplates, cast bars, combo points, player/target/pet/party frames, character sheet, spellbook, professions window, the classic bottom bar with its micro buttons, bags and XP bar, minimap, quest tracker. Each part can be switched off.
